          "relevance": 0.939,
          "lineage": "verbatim",
          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "On the Free plan a workspace can have 3 active projects. Archived projects do not count toward that limit. Paid plans have unlimited projects."
        },
        {
          "token_budget": null,
